# Express trust proxy setting. Default: 'loopback' (only trust X-Forwarded-* headers from
# 127.0.0.1/::1, the safe default behind a single reverse proxy). Set to a comma-separated
# list of CIDR blocks ('192.168.0.0/16,10.0.0.0/8') if you run multiple proxies, or
# 'true' to trust all proxies (NOT recommended in production — opens IP-spoofing risk).
TRUST_PROXY=loopback
